Preview contact rows in the Project Contacts sidebar had interactive styling (`cursor-pointer`, `hover:bg-gray-100`) but no click handlers, creating a non-functional affordance.

**Changes:**
- Added `onClick` handler that filters main contact list by setting `activeCategory` and `searchTerm` to the clicked contact
- Added keyboard navigation (`onKeyDown` for Enter/Space) and ARIA attributes (`role="button"`, `tabIndex={0}`)

```jsx
<div
  onClick={() => {
    setActiveCategory(cat.id);
    setSearchTerm(`${contact.first_name} ${contact.last_name}`);
  }}
  role="button"
  tabIndex={0}
  onKeyDown={(e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
      e.preventDefault();
      setActiveCategory(cat.id);
      setSearchTerm(`${contact.first_name} ${contact.last_name}`);
    }
  }}
>
  {contact.first_name} {contact.last_name}
</div>
```

