# Add Word Suggestion Feature to WordSearchGenerator

## Overview
Add a word suggestion feature to the root-level WordSearchGenerator application that extracts significant words from selected Bible verses and displays them as clickable chips for easy addition to the target words list.

**Note**: This is simpler than the CrosswordGenerator version - only display the WORD itself, no verse context snippets.

## Location
Modify files in the root directory:
- `index.html` - Add UI elements for word suggestions
- `script.js` - Add word extraction and suggestion logic

## Feature Requirements

### 1. Word Extraction Logic (script.js)

Add a function to extract suggested words from verse text (same filtering as CrosswordGenerator):

```javascript
function extractSuggestedWords(verseText) {
  // Common words to filter out
  const commonWords = new Set([
    'a', 'an', 'the', 'and', 'or', 'but', 'of', 'to', 'in', 'is', 'was', 
    'were', 'be', 'been', 'being', 'have', 'has', 'had', 'do', 'does', 'did',
    'will', 'would', 'should', 'could', 'may', 'might', 'can', 'shall', 
    'am', 'are', 'for', 'with', 'at', 'by', 'from', 'as', 'on', 'it',
    'he', 'she', 'they', 'them', 'his', 'her', 'their', 'this', 'that',
    'these', 'those', 'not', 'no', 'yes', 'if', 'then', 'than', 'all',
    'any', 'some', 'my', 'me', 'you', 'your', 'we', 'us', 'our', 'him',
    'into', 'up', 'out', 'who', 'what', 'when', 'where', 'which', 'why', 'how'
  ]);

  // Extract words
  const words = verseText.match(/[a-zA-Z]+/g) || [];
  const suggestions = [];
  const seen = new Set();

  for (const word of words) {
    const cleanWord = word.toUpperCase();

    // Filter: must be 4+ letters, not common, not duplicate
    if (cleanWord.length >= 4 && 
        !commonWords.has(word.toLowerCase()) && 
        !seen.has(cleanWord)) {

      suggestions.push(cleanWord);
      seen.add(cleanWord);
    }
  }

  // Sort by length (longest first)
  suggestions.sort((a, b) => b.length - a.length);

  return suggestions;
}
```

