Add CSS for word chips in the `<style>` section:

```css
.word-chip {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  background: var(--accent-color);
  color: white;
  border-radius: 20px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  border: 2px solid transparent;
  user-select: none;
}

.word-chip:hover {
  background: var(--accent-hover);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.word-chip.added {
  background: var(--text-secondary);
  opacity: 0.6;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.word-chip.added:hover {
  transform: none;
}
```

